      "source_image_index": null,
      "ownership": "unknown"
    },
    "parts": [],
    "answer_text": "The poet refers to the time as being sluttish as it changes suddenly and unexpectedly. Its habits and behaviour are unpredictable. It turns favourite circumstances into adverse circumstances. It neither waits nor cares for anyone. It spares no one. Nobody can understand its changing mood.",
    "answer_latex": null,
    "steps": [],
    "final_answer": "Thus, the poet highlights the unpredictable nature of time.",
